### ===== CONDOMINIUM =====
# @name listCondominium
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/condominium
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by id
# @name searchCondominium
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/condominium/8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Insert
# @name insertCondominium
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/condominium
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Boa Vista",
    "cnpj": "12345678910111",
    "amount_blocks": 4,
    "amount_apartments": 160,
    "email": "teste@teste1.com",
    "password": "OiCamila"
}

### Update
# @name updateCondominium
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/condominium/7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bela Vista",
  "cnpj": "12345678910124",
  "amount_blocks": 4,
  "amount_apartments": 160,
  "email": "contato@scotti.com.br"
}

### Delete
# @name deleteCondominium
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/condominium/11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


